<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Analog Devices cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Analog Devices cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it downgraded Analog Devices Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said the business environment is improving but is not expanding as fast as previously expected.</p>
<p>-- said the company will have higher expenses due to some wafer start-up costs.</p>
<p>-- said maintains 12-month target price of $29 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the stock could &quot;easily decline&quot; 20 percent on any weakness in the semiconductor group.</p>
<p>-- Analog Devices was off 1-3/4 to 26-1/8.</p>
</text>
